      "statement": "The workshop module exposes WORKSHOP_STEP_IDS derived from the tuple, the isWorkshopStepId type guard, a one-based workshopStepRank, and workshopStepFocus which renders the prefix 【第 N 步 · label】 and returns an empty string for an unknown id so a stale id yields no prefix rather than a malformed one.",
      "evidence": [
