      "id": "claim_c4f8efdbdc154a83b91bdc3367baa94b",
      "statement": "REVERSE_CONTRACT_MODE declares the no-contract opening as id reverse-contract, label 无合同逆推, a hint about deriving the agreement from receipts and liability, and the prompt prefix 【无合同逆推 · 从凭证与追责推导合约】, so a business with no agreement to read is named in one move instead of re-explained every turn.",
