      "statement": "MODELING_PROMPT states six non-negotiable red lines — key data must have a provider, computable values must be derivation rules, complex computation moves into a domain calculator or checker, derivations read modeled attributes only, a fulfillment request references its root contract with one request and one result end per pair, and evidence, responsible role and owning context are saved as one minimal unit — plus a key-data ledger format and a five-item business-semantics review.",
